Douyin Downloader is a '''cross-platform''' download tool for Douyin videos, built with '''Tauri'''. It provides a simple and convenient way to download videos from Douyin, a popular Chinese social media platform. The tool is available for '''Windows''', '''MacOS''', and '''Linux''' operating systems.

== Overview ==
The Douyin Downloader is a '''free''' and '''open-source''' tool that allows users to download Douyin videos with ease. It is built using '''Tauri''', a framework for building '''cross-platform''' desktop applications. The tool has a simple and intuitive interface, making it easy for users to download their favorite Douyin videos.

=== Features ===
The Douyin Downloader has several key features, including:
* '''Cross-platform''' support: The tool is available for '''Windows''', '''MacOS''', and '''Linux''' operating systems.
* '''Easy to use''': The tool has a simple and intuitive interface, making it easy for users to download Douyin videos.
* '''Fast download speeds''': The tool allows for fast download speeds, making it convenient for users to download their favorite videos.

== Installation ==
To install the Douyin Downloader, users can download the latest release from the [https://github.com/lzdyes/douyin-downloader/releases GitHub releases page]. The tool supports '''Windows x64''', '''Linux x86_64''', and '''macOS 10.13+'''. Alternatively, users can build the tool themselves using the source code. Note that '''Webview2''' is required to run the app on '''Windows''', and can be downloaded from the [https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/webview2/#download-section Microsoft Edge Webview2 website].

